WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.766
Contracts are long, and the costly parts are easy to miss.

00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:04.825
Brief fixes that.

00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:07.654
Upload a lease, loan or job offer.

00:00:07.654 --> 00:00:09.398
A PDF, or just a photo.

00:00:09.648 --> 00:00:15.003
Brief reads every clause and pulls out the key terms: money, dates, and how to get out.

00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:16.075
Ask anything.

00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:21.385
Every answer cites the exact clause, and if the document doesn't say, Brief says so.

00:00:21.635 --> 00:00:25.528
It lists what to ask before you sign, and drafts the email for you.

00:00:25.778 --> 00:00:27.358
Your documents stay private.

00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:32.550
Sign in with Google, add two step verification, and share read only with people you approve.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.163
Brief.

00:00:33.163 --> 00:00:34.673
Know what you're signing.
